            <h1 class="display-2 fw-bold my-4">
              OVERSIZED PREMIUM STYLE
            </h1>

            <p class="fs-5 mb-4">
              Inspired by modern fashion culture with luxury minimalist aesthetics.
            </p>

            <button class="btn btn-light px-4 py-3 fw-bold">
              EXPLORE NOW
